<title>CHINA: Boram Bank in US$80 million FRN.</title>
<headline>Boram Bank in US$80 million FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boram Bank has completed a US$80 million floating rate notes issue on a club basis, bankers said.</p>
<p>The three-year notes have annual put and annual call options, they said, but gave no pricing information.</p>
<p>The notes are issued under a US$1.5 billion global medium-term note programme signed in May.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
